          <h3>Important</h3>
          <ul>
          <li>Initial release.</li>
          <li>Requires Mac OS X 13.0 (Ventura) or newer.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Fixes & Improvements</h3>
          <ul>
          <li>Six-key (Perkins) braille input, translated with Liblouis (UEB grade 1 &amp; 2).</li>
          <li>Grade 1 types each character live as you braille it.</li>
          <li>Works with VoiceOver: the dot keys are no longer spoken over the braille.</li>
          <li>Braille View adapts to light and dark mode.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
